 "notes": "Old models kept as versions (Cartier none; David Yurman Cable Classics; Pandora Moments x2). Choor/kada/kankan moved from m to Bangle types; Kara archetype added. Dropped 'Diamond Harem Slave Armlet' (retail SKU noise; one Chainmail & More armlet kept). No sourced versions found for Hermès Clic H, Cartier Love SM/Unlimited or Serpenti Tubogas, so left out. Beaded and Friendship bracelets have no archetypes (no maker-defined icons found); patterns kept as types. Hand harness keeps old AMYO models. Tennis bracelet naming: Wikipedia gives 1978 US Open, many sources say 1987. 'concha belt' in tradition forms is from general knowledge of the form list, to verify."
